1. **Coder:** Opus 5 max-effort subagent, one commit per round (C5a+C5b, C10a+C10b may share a round). Source = `git -C ~/codespace/FLAC show f59f5a4:<path>`; the Coder transplants, strips experiment references, applies the Rev 3 additions, and runs the tests.
