   208	        ``fa_invariant`` routes through the yaw-symmetrized path (cylindrical
   209	        pose features + C4 frame average of the ViT conditioners); ``vanilla``
   210	        is the unchanged single conditioner pass. Called from training_step,
   211	        validation_step AND test_step so all inference/training sites share one
